  "slug": "azure-web-app-front-door",
  "title": "Zone-redundant web app behind Front Door",
  "description": "Front Door Premium is the only public surface: WAF and TLS at the edge, Private Link to an App Service origin with no public endpoint. In the primary region App Service, Azure SQL, Cache for Redis and Storage are zone redundant and reached over private endpoints from the integration subnet; a failover group replicates SQL to a second region where a warm standby App Service waits as origin priority 2. Managed identity, Key Vault, Application Insights and Log Analytics complete the picture.",
